      "id": "exam/edexcel-9fm0-02-sample/q1",
      "question": "<p>The roots of the equation</p><div class=\"equation\" data-math=\"x^3-8x^2+28x-32=0\" data-display=\"true\"></div><p>are <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\alpha\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\beta\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\gamma\"></span></p><p>Without solving the equation, find the value of</p><ol class=\"parts\" type=\"i\"><li><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\dfrac1\\alpha+\\dfrac1\\beta+\\dfrac1\\gamma\"></span></li><li><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(\\alpha+2)(\\beta+2)(\\gamma+2)\"></span></li><li><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\alpha^2+\\beta^2+\\gamma^2\"></span></li></ol><span class=\"marks\">(8)</span>",
