    {
      "id": "exam/edexcel-9fm0-02-sample/q2",
      "question": "<p>The plane <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\Pi_1\"></span> has vector equation</p><div class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\mathbf r\\cdot(3\\mathbf i-4\\mathbf j+2\\mathbf k)=5\" data-display=\"true\"></div><ol class=\"parts\"><li>Find the perpendicular distance from the point <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(6, 2, 12)\"></span> to the plane <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\Pi_1\"></span> <span class=\"marks\">(3)</span></li></ol><p>The plane <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\Pi_2\"></span> has vector equation</p><div class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\mathbf r=\\lambda(2\\mathbf i+\\mathbf j+5\\mathbf k)+\\mu(\\mathbf i-\\mathbf j-2\\mathbf k)\" data-display=\"true\"></div><p>where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\lambda\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mu\"></span> are scalar parameters.</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"2\"><li>Show that the vector <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"-\\mathbf i-3\\mathbf j+\\mathbf k\"></span> is perpendicular to <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\Pi_2\"></span> <span class=\"marks\">(2)</span></li><li>Show that the acute angle between <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\Pi_1\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\Pi_2\"></span> is <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"52^\\circ\"></span> to the nearest degree. <span class=\"marks\">(3)</span></li></ol>",
